// Consistency of overload layers: verification, not
// synchronization. ;
// 
// The general instruction was corrected only in the most general overload - a
// copy in another overload has the label "diverged".
// program: editor_overload_layers.vish
open_view module
// expect-not: kind="diverged"
pointer 1 @* 1 1
key 1 Delete
key 1 +
key 1 Escape
// expect: y = x + x;
// copy in folded overload f64 - the label is visible when shown in place (frame "Layers")
layer 1 next:@norm
// expect: kind="diverged" text="разошлось с общей логикой: в norm(x) этой инструкции больше нет"
